    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional A2-Rated Spacious 5 Bed Detached Family Home with Attic Conversion.\r\n\r\nA superb family residence extending over three spacious storeys, located in one of Cavan Town's most sought-after residential developments. Constructed in 2021 and boasting an impressive A2 BER, this contemporary home combines stylish design, generous living accommodation and exceptional energy efficiency, making it an ideal choice for modern family living.\r\n\r\nFinished to a high standard throughout, the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation with quality finishes, an excellent layout and the added benefit of a fully converted attic providing valuable additional living space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMODATION \r\n\r\nGround Floor \r\nEntrance Hall: 12.5 m2 \r\nLiving Room: 22m2\r\nKitchen Dining Room: 27.1 m2 \r\nSunroom: 11.1m2 \r\nUtility: 3.7m2 \r\nGuest W.C: 2.2 m2 \r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\nLanding: 3.07 m2\r\nBedroom 1: 4.6 m2 \r\nBedroom 2: 8.4 m2 \r\nBedroom 3: 12.8 m2 \r\nMaster Bedroom: 14 m2 w/ ensuite 4.2 m2\r\nMain Bathroom: 4.5 m2 \r\n\r\nSecond Floor/ Converted Attic Space\r\nBedroom 4: 26.6 m2 w/ ensuite (6.6 m2) \r\n\r\nTotal floor area: c.183.02 m2\r\n\r\nSERVICES: \r\nALL MAINS SERVICES"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\n\r\n•\tApprox. three-storey private accommodation\r\n•\tFive well-proportioned bedrooms \r\n•\tBuilt in storage\r\n•\tSpacious second floor attic conversion with generous second Master style Suite & ensuite & Excellent eaves storage\r\n•\tSpacious contemporary open plan fitted kitchen \r\n•\tSunroom with abundant natural light\r\n•\tThree bathrooms including 2 ensuite\r\n•\tAir-to-water heating system\r\n•\tHigh levels of insulation for reduced energy costs\r\n•\tDouble-glazed windows throughout\r\n•\tEnclosed rear garden\r\n•\tOff-street parking\r\n•\tWalking distance to Cavan Town Centre\r\n•\tExcellent commuter access to the N3\r\n•\tAll Mains Services"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Location\r\n\r\nSituated on the popular Ballinagh Rd, Creighan Manor is  just minutes from the town centre. Residents benefit from easy access to primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, healthcare facilities, leisure amenities and numerous sporting clubs.\r\nThe location also provides convenient access to the N3 - Dublin, Enniskillen and the wider region, making it an ideal base for commuters and growing families alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the full potential of this substantial property."
      }
    ],
